266
00:23:12.360 --> 00:23:14.120
You wanna be a journalist?
That's the job.

267
00:23:14.200 --> 00:23:15.920
- Hey. Lee.
- What?

268
00:23:16.080 --> 00:23:17.120
Back off.

269
00:23:17.480 --> 00:23:18.800
What am I saying that's wrong?

270
00:23:18.880 --> 00:23:21.280
I'm not saying it's wrong.
she's just shook up.

271
00:23:21.560 --> 00:23:23.200
Lee doesn't understand "shook up".

272
00:23:24.640 --> 00:23:26.480
I'm not being protective of her?

273
00:23:26.800 --> 00:23:29.000
You're the idiot
who let her in this car.

274
00:23:30.400 --> 00:23:32.920
What happened back there
is nothing in comparison

275
00:23:33.000 --> 00:23:34.360
to what we're heading into.

276
00:23:34.520 --> 00:23:35.800
You need to understand...

277
00:23:37.240 --> 00:23:39.040
Holy shit. she's crying.

278
00:23:40.440 --> 00:23:43.280
The back seat is both kindergarten

279
00:23:43.760 --> 00:23:45.120
and an old people's home.

280
00:23:46.280 --> 00:23:47.280
How did this happen?

281
00:23:47.360 --> 00:23:48.760
Lee. what the fuck?

282
00:23:49.240 --> 00:23:50.240
Lee's right.

283
00:23:54.760 --> 00:23:56.520
I won't make that mistake again.

284
00:24:04.280 --> 00:24:06.680
<i>The terms of
the so-called Peace Summit</i>

285
00:24:06.760 --> 00:24:09.320
<i>could only be rejected.
fully rejected</i>

286
00:24:09.400 --> 00:24:11.880
<i>by all right-thinking Americans.</i>

287
00:24:13.320 --> 00:24:16.200
<i>To the secessionists.
I say only this.</i>

288
00:24:17.800 --> 00:24:22.880
<i>I pledge allegiance to the flag
of the United States of America.</i>

289
00:24:24.440 --> 00:24:28.080
<i>We stand ready to fulfill
the promise of our forefathers</i>

290
00:24:28.400 --> 00:24:31.200
<i>to the flag. to the nation</i>

291
00:24:32.520 --> 00:24:33.760
<i>and to God.</i>

292
00:24:37.920 --> 00:24:39.120
Stop here a minute.

293
00:24:40.480 --> 00:24:42.400
Seem like a good place
for a toilet break?

294
00:24:42.480 --> 00:24:43.480
Just pull in.

295
00:24:58.160 --> 00:24:59.160
Come with me.

296
00:25:04.120 --> 00:25:05.120
Come with me.

297
00:25:38.880 --> 00:25:39.880
Shoot it.

298
00:25:42.320 --> 00:25:44.040
- Shoot the helicopter?
- Yeah.

299
00:25:45.080 --> 00:25:46.400
It's gonna make a good image.

300
00:26:14.080 --> 00:26:15.080
FE2s.

301
00:26:15.680 --> 00:26:17.120
You don't see them around much.

302
00:26:17.680 --> 00:26:18.680
Yeah.

303
00:26:18.960 --> 00:26:20.680
They were my dad's cameras actually.

304
00:26:22.280 --> 00:26:24.680
Don't worry. he's not dead. He's...

305
00:26:25.520 --> 00:26:26.920
sitting on his farm in Missouri

306
00:26:27.000 --> 00:26:28.880
pretending like
none of this is happening.

307
00:26:44.840 --> 00:26:45.840
Lee

308
00:26:47.000 --> 00:26:50.000
I'm sorry for jamming my way
into your ride. okay?

309
00:26:50.320 --> 00:26:51.920
I know you're really angry about it

310
00:26:52.000 --> 00:26:54.320
and I know you think
I don't know shit. but...

311
00:26:54.400 --> 00:26:56.520
I'm not angry about that. Jesse.

312
00:26:57.120 --> 00:26:59.360
I don't care what you do
or don't know.

313
00:26:59.440 --> 00:27:01.480
Okay. but you are angry with me.

314
00:27:01.920 --> 00:27:05.640
There is no version of this
that isn't a mistake.

315
00:27:06.320 --> 00:27:08.320
I know. because I'm it.

316
00:27:09.400 --> 00:27:10.800
Joe and Sammy are it.

317
00:27:11.600 --> 00:27:13.080
- It's my choice.
- Right.

318
00:27:14.360 --> 00:27:15.640
And I'll remember that

319
00:27:16.040 --> 00:27:19.640
when you lose your shit.
or you get blown up or shot.

320
00:27:22.960 --> 00:27:25.760
Would you photograph that moment
if I got shot?

321
00:27:28.160 --> 00:27:29.280
What do you think?

322
00:27:43.200 --> 00:27:47.520
Every time I survived a war zone
and got the photo

323
00:27:48.600 --> 00:27:50.760
I thought I was sending
a warning home.

324
00:27:51.800 --> 00:27:53.200
"Don't do this."

325
00:27:54.400 --> 00:27:55.680
But here we are.

326
00:27:58.400 --> 00:28:00.240
So it's existential.

327
00:28:01.120 --> 00:28:02.120
What is?

328
00:28:02.720 --> 00:28:03.880
What's eating you.

329
00:28:07.840 --> 00:28:09.800
Don't worry about me. Sammy.

330
00:28:12.920 --> 00:28:16.080
Am I allowed to say
I remember you at her age?

331
00:28:17.760 --> 00:28:18.960
And I wasn't so different?

332
00:28:19.040 --> 00:28:20.440
You weren't so different.

333
00:28:20.720 --> 00:28:22.120
You think you're being hard on her

334
00:28:22.200 --> 00:28:24.440
and I think
you're being hard on yourself.

335
00:28:25.080 --> 00:28:26.080
Okay. writer.

336
00:28:26.160 --> 00:28:27.160
Damn it. Lee.

337
00:28:27.320 --> 00:28:28.360
Stop.

338
00:28:29.200 --> 00:28:30.400
I'm speaking truth.

339
00:28:30.840 --> 00:28:33.360
And for the record. sure.
I'm worried about that girl.

340
00:28:33.920 --> 00:28:35.760
And I'm worried about you too.

341
00:28:38.000 --> 00:28:39.440
What are you worrying about Lee for?

342
00:28:41.520 --> 00:28:44.320
Lee's lost her faith
in the power of journalism.

343
00:28:44.960 --> 00:28:47.000
State of the nation is QED.

344
00:28:47.400 --> 00:28:49.200
I can't answer to that. Sammy.

345
00:28:49.920 --> 00:28:51.200
But I can tell you

346
00:28:52.200 --> 00:28:53.520
this gunfire

347
00:28:54.120 --> 00:28:56.760
is getting me extremely fucking hard.

348
00:28:58.320 --> 00:29:00.320
Look at that shit light up the sky.

349
00:29:00.560 --> 00:29:01.720
It's not our story.

350
00:29:02.320 --> 00:29:03.360
Yeah.

351
00:29:04.000 --> 00:29:06.680
But you know. bang bang.

352
00:29:07.040 --> 00:29:09.200
We're not going anywhere near that
in the dark.

353
00:29:10.000 --> 00:29:11.000
But sun up.

354
00:29:12.680 --> 00:29:14.920
If they're still at it.
we'll take a look.

355
00:29:20.920 --> 00:29:21.920
Cool.

356
00:29:29.200 --> 00:29:30.200
Thanks.

357
00:29:59.400 --> 00:30:00.640
Action tomorrow.

358
00:30:02.960 --> 00:30:04.080
We're going down there?

359
00:30:04.440 --> 00:30:05.440
Yeah.

360
00:30:09.240 --> 00:30:10.320
But not you.

361
00:30:11.040 --> 00:30:12.040
You're gonna...

362
00:30:12.400 --> 00:30:13.560
You're gonna hang back.

363
00:30:15.320 --> 00:30:16.320
I don't wanna hang back.

364
00:30:16.400 --> 00:30:17.680
You'll have to hang back.

365
00:30:19.280 --> 00:30:21.240
I'm not hanging back.

366
00:30:24.440 --> 00:30:25.840
You should see your face.

367
00:30:27.320 --> 00:30:29.520
Stomach doing turns. Right?

368
00:30:31.520 --> 00:30:33.680
You won't get
a minute of sleep tonight.

369
00:30:34.920 --> 00:30:35.920
My advice

370
00:30:36.600 --> 00:30:38.480
don't expect to sleep.

371
00:30:38.680 --> 00:30:40.240
That way if you do. it's a...

372
00:30:40.640 --> 00:30:42.000
it's a nice surprise.

373
00:30:46.360 --> 00:30:47.480
You're gonna sleep?

374
00:30:50.840 --> 00:30:52.680
I got out-of-date Ativan.

375
00:30:55.840 --> 00:30:57.640
Got plenty.
I can give you some if you like.

376
00:30:58.280 --> 00:30:59.360
Oh. no. It's okay.

377
00:31:00.120 --> 00:31:03.000
Or I can stay up with you.

378
00:31:03.880 --> 00:31:04.960
Keep you company.

379
00:31:07.040 --> 00:31:08.640
No. I...

380
00:31:09.240 --> 00:31:12.800
I don't wanna be
a burden or whatever.

381
00:31:16.520 --> 00:31:17.520
You sure?

382
00:31:21.480 --> 00:31:22.560
But seriously

383
00:31:22.840 --> 00:31:26.760
if you do get freaked out
or something. just wake me up.

384
00:31:27.720 --> 00:31:29.560
It's not nice being scared alone.

385
00:31:33.240 --> 00:31:34.360
Thanks. Joe.

386
00:31:35.880 --> 00:31:37.000
You bet. darlin'.

387
00:32:41.520 --> 00:32:42.520
Get down!

388
00:32:42.760 --> 00:32:44.880
I said go flank the building!

389
00:32:44.960 --> 00:32:46.200
- Alright. Mike!
- Fuck!

390
00:32:48.360 --> 00:32:49.360
Mike. come on!

391
00:32:53.400 --> 00:32:54.600
Get me the fuck out of here!

392
00:32:55.600 --> 00:32:58.040
I said go flank the fucking building!

393
00:32:58.120 --> 00:32:59.120
Got it.

394
00:33:01.600 --> 00:33:02.600
Do something!

395
00:33:03.720 --> 00:33:04.776
- If I run now.
- Get ready to move.

396
00:33:04.800 --> 00:33:05.896
- I'm gonna get hit! Get me
- Prep the smoke.

397
00:33:05.920 --> 00:33:07.120
- The fuck out of here!
- Okay!

398
00:33:10.560 --> 00:33:12.000
- Fuck!
- Smoke out!

399
00:33:15.880 --> 00:33:17.000
On the count of three.

400
00:33:17.080 --> 00:33:18.720
Three. two. one.

401
00:33:18.800 --> 00:33:19.800
- Go!
- Cover me!

402
00:33:31.800 --> 00:33:33.360
- Fuck!
- Mike's down.

403
00:33:33.440 --> 00:33:34.600
- Fuck!
- Shit!

404
00:33:35.920 --> 00:33:37.176
- I'm gonna get him!
- Go get him!

405
00:33:37.200 --> 00:33:38.480
Now! Now. move it!

406
00:33:38.560 --> 00:33:39.640
You gotta move!

407
00:33:48.040 --> 00:33:49.720
Mike's down! We gotta get him!

408
00:33:49.800 --> 00:33:51.600
Mike's down. I'm gonna get him.

409
00:33:55.920 --> 00:33:56.920
Move back!

410
00:33:57.640 --> 00:33:58.640
Move back!

411
00:34:07.600 --> 00:34:09.520
I gotcha. hang in. Stay with me.

412
00:34:12.800 --> 00:34:14.000
Fuck. get me gauze.

413
00:34:26.880 --> 00:34:27.880
Fuck it!

414
00:36:25.080 --> 00:36:26.160
No.

415
00:38:13.200 --> 00:38:16.200
Holy fucking shit!

416
00:38:16.680 --> 00:38:18.560
What a fucking rush!

417
00:38:46.040 --> 00:38:47.560
- You're press?
- Yes. ma'am.

418
00:38:48.400 --> 00:38:49.400
IDs.

419
00:38:55.160 --> 00:38:56.960
Okay. Are you staying the night?

420
00:38:57.040 --> 00:38:58.080
Yeah. just one.

421
00:39:00.200 --> 00:39:01.360
Park over there.

422
00:39:01.800 --> 00:39:03.320
There's a canteen where you can eat.

423
00:39:03.400 --> 00:39:05.240
And no tents available.

424
00:39:05.320 --> 00:39:06.320
Thanks. ma'am.

425
00:39:30.320 --> 00:39:31.320
You're good.

426
00:39:33.800 --> 00:39:35.880
- Hey. get in there.
- I'm gonna show these kids.

427
00:39:35.960 --> 00:39:37.400
- Yeah.
- Check this out. Okay!

428
00:39:37.800 --> 00:39:41.200
- One. two three. four...
- 11. 12. 13...

429
00:39:41.920 --> 00:39:43.120
Can I go next?

430
00:39:43.640 --> 00:39:44.680
Your turn. Sammy.

431
00:39:46.440 --> 00:39:47.480
Hey. wait up!

432
00:40:08.000 --> 00:40:09.000
Brought you something.

433
00:40:09.080 --> 00:40:10.080
Thanks.

434
00:40:14.280 --> 00:40:15.400
Don't forget to eat.

435
00:40:15.560 --> 00:40:16.760
Yeah. I'm starving.

436
00:40:20.200 --> 00:40:22.400
I'll eat once I'm done with this.

437
00:40:23.200 --> 00:40:25.040
Developing negs on the road.

438
00:40:25.600 --> 00:40:27.800
Yeah. I got myself
a pretty neat travel kit.

439
00:40:28.720 --> 00:40:29.720
I'm impressed.

440
00:40:30.680 --> 00:40:33.040
Want to know the secret of
getting the developer just right?

441
00:40:36.560 --> 00:40:37.680
Body temperature.

442
00:40:37.960 --> 00:40:39.520
- Smart.
- Thank you.

443
00:40:44.520 --> 00:40:47.720
So. how about
you tell me the story of

444
00:40:47.800 --> 00:40:49.680
how you became a photo journalist?

445
00:40:50.640 --> 00:40:51.640
You don't know?

446
00:40:52.320 --> 00:40:53.800
Thought I was one of your heroes.

447
00:40:55.680 --> 00:40:57.560
Yeah. I do.

448
00:40:58.440 --> 00:40:59.600
When you were in college

449
00:40:59.680 --> 00:41:04.160
you took the motherfucking legendary
photo of the ANTIFA massacre.

450
00:41:05.480 --> 00:41:09.640
And then you became the youngest
ever Magnum photographer.

451
00:41:11.120 --> 00:41:13.560
That would be my Wikipedia page.

452
00:41:13.640 --> 00:41:15.120
But what's missing from it?

453
00:41:15.760 --> 00:41:18.040
I don't know. A lot.

454
00:41:20.800 --> 00:41:22.680
Well. that's gotta sit here
for ten minutes

455
00:41:22.760 --> 00:41:24.400
so you might as well expand a little.

456
00:41:25.720 --> 00:41:26.800
What about your folks?

457
00:41:28.280 --> 00:41:30.960
Well. actually.
they're on a farm too.

458
00:41:31.440 --> 00:41:32.720
Except Colorado.

459
00:41:33.200 --> 00:41:35.880
Also pretending this isn't happening.

460
00:41:36.600 --> 00:41:37.720
No shit.

461
00:41:41.680 --> 00:41:43.120
Hey. these are dry.

462
00:41:43.640 --> 00:41:44.960
Should we check them out?

463
00:41:45.040 --> 00:41:46.040
Sure.

464
00:41:46.720 --> 00:41:48.880
Still need a phone even though
you can't get a signal.

465
00:41:59.240 --> 00:42:00.560
I don't want you to see these.

466
00:42:02.320 --> 00:42:04.360
They're not even in focus. Like...

467
00:42:04.880 --> 00:42:06.120
Exposure all wrong.

468
00:42:06.200 --> 00:42:07.320
Just keep looking.

469
00:42:08.720 --> 00:42:12.040
I figure the strike rate
for keepers is 30 to one.

470
00:42:37.120 --> 00:42:39.480
It's a great photo. Jessie.

471
00:44:53.360 --> 00:44:55.680
Did we just drive through
a time portal?

472
00:44:56.760 --> 00:44:58.320
It's The Twilight Zone.

473
00:45:26.760 --> 00:45:28.360
Hey there. Welcome.

474
00:45:28.680 --> 00:45:30.160
Feel free to look around.

475
00:45:43.640 --> 00:45:44.640
Hey.

476
00:45:46.520 --> 00:45:47.560
Out of interest

477
00:45:49.320 --> 00:45:50.840
are you guys aware there's like a...

478
00:45:52.000 --> 00:45:55.120
pretty huge civil war
going on all across America?

479
00:45:56.040 --> 00:45:58.920
Sure. but we just try to stay out.

480
00:46:03.640 --> 00:46:04.640
Stay out?

481
00:46:05.040 --> 00:46:08.040
With what we see on the news.
seems like it's for the best.

482
00:46:10.800 --> 00:46:11.800
Yeah.

483
00:46:12.360 --> 00:46:14.280
Well. let me know
if you want to try anything on.

484
00:46:15.360 --> 00:46:16.360
Thanks.

485
00:46:17.880 --> 00:46:18.880
Lee.

486
00:46:23.200 --> 00:46:24.200
What?

487
00:46:24.760 --> 00:46:26.880
You're so war-torn
you can't try on a dress?

488
00:46:43.240 --> 00:46:44.240
Jesus.

489
00:46:45.880 --> 00:46:47.720
When you haven't seen
yourself in the mirror...

490
00:46:47.760 --> 00:46:49.840
- Oh. my God. Shut the fuck up.
- In a few days.

491
00:46:51.040 --> 00:46:52.680
Turn around.
I want to take your photo.

492
00:46:55.280 --> 00:46:56.280
No.

493
00:46:57.280 --> 00:46:58.280
It's... Come on.

494
00:46:59.200 --> 00:47:00.200
Yes.

495
00:47:15.040 --> 00:47:16.520
Are you gonna take the photo?

496
00:47:16.880 --> 00:47:18.160
Told me not to rush.

497
00:47:18.400 --> 00:47:20.800
Yeah. but there's a sweet spot.
and you're missing it.

498
00:47:21.240 --> 00:47:22.760
Don't wanna miss your sweet spot.

499
00:47:24.800 --> 00:47:27.000
Well. no. that was not the moment.

500
00:47:29.040 --> 00:47:30.040
Okay.

501
00:47:30.360 --> 00:47:31.360
One more.

502
00:47:37.320 --> 00:47:38.840
- Lee?
- Yes.

503
00:47:39.200 --> 00:47:40.360
You're pretty when you smile.

504
00:47:43.360 --> 00:47:44.360
There you go.

505
00:47:45.560 --> 00:47:46.560
Hey.

506
00:47:48.880 --> 00:47:50.040
How about this?

507
00:47:51.600 --> 00:47:52.720
Yeah. nice.

508
00:47:54.920 --> 00:47:56.200
You're not gonna take a picture?

509
00:47:56.640 --> 00:47:57.640
Right.

510
00:47:58.320 --> 00:48:01.120
You know what. though?
Running a little low on film.

511
00:48:03.840 --> 00:48:04.880
You're mean.

512
00:48:05.320 --> 00:48:06.320
I'm out.

513
00:48:12.080 --> 00:48:13.080
I'm gonna go try this on.

514
00:48:27.240 --> 00:48:29.040
You actually bought something?

515
00:48:32.000 --> 00:48:33.000
She did.

516
00:48:33.320 --> 00:48:34.320
She's paying now.

517
00:48:38.080 --> 00:48:39.200
It's so weird.

518
00:48:40.080 --> 00:48:42.440
This place is like
everything I'd forgotten.

519
00:48:43.160 --> 00:48:44.240
Funny.

520
00:48:44.320 --> 00:48:47.120
I was thinking it felt like
everything I remembered.

521
00:48:49.160 --> 00:48:51.000
Look at the tops of the buildings.

522
00:48:51.240 --> 00:48:52.240
Be subtle.

523
00:49:07.760 --> 00:49:09.760
Wouldn't have suited us anyway. Lee.

524
00:49:10.800 --> 00:49:12.280
We'd have gotten bored.

525
00:49:13.960 --> 00:49:15.920
<i>I remain ready to accept</i>

526
00:49:16.000 --> 00:49:21.520
<i>the full. immediate and unconditional
surrender of the Secessionist forces.</i>

527
00:49:21.800 --> 00:49:25.240
<i>To deliberate the people
of the subjugated states</i>

528
00:49:25.320 --> 00:49:27.600
<i>and start rebuilding
our great nation.</i>

529
00:49:27.680 --> 00:49:29.920
- I've had enough of this shit.
- <i>The land of the free...</i>

530
00:49:30.280 --> 00:49:32.040
Words might as well be random.

531
00:49:32.280 --> 00:49:33.720
What do you think he'll actually say

532
00:49:33.760 --> 00:49:35.720
if I do get a mic in front of him?

533
00:49:35.800 --> 00:49:36.920
Not much.

534
00:49:37.400 --> 00:49:41.320
The ones that get taken.
Qaddafi. Mussolini. Ceauşescu

535
00:49:41.640 --> 00:49:44.080
they're always lesser men
than you think.

536
00:49:44.160 --> 00:49:46.200
At the end. he'll let you down. Joe.

537
00:49:46.280 --> 00:49:48.720
Just as long as he isn't dead
